  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana igoro y’egeita kia moocha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omonto oria akang’ira gochia ase egeita gia isiko kiarenge ensemo ya moocha ye Hekalu; egeita ekio nigo giasiekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene aganteebia, “Egeita eke nigo keragenderere gosiekwa, tigekoigorwa rinde, na monto onde tagosoera aroro, ekiagera aiga nao Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, asoerete ime. Ase ayio goika kegenderere gosiekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omogambi bweka nere oraikaranseo ariere endagera ase obosio bw’Omonene. Nigo arasoere goetera gesona ki’oboagacho bore geita, naende asokere enchera eyio eyio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko y’ogosoa ase Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akang’ira, akang’eteria ase egeita gia sugusu, bosio bwe Hekalu; nkarigereria nkarora obonene bw’Omonene bwaichoire ase enyomba y’Omonene. Agwo ngatung’ama inse nkaumama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omonene aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, rengereria mono, origererie n’amaiso ao, na oigwe namato ao amang’ana onsi ngochia kogotebia igoro y’emeroberio echiikire ase enyomba y’Omonene, na amachiiko onsi igoro y’enyomba eye. Origererie mono buna abanto baranyare gosoa ase enyomba y’Omonene na buna baranyare gosoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oteebie abanto b’egesaku ki’Abaisraeli, abwo bare abasaria, ng’a aya naro inche Omonene ngoteeba: Inwe Abaisraeli, tiga ogokora kwaino gw’okogechia goisanere agwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mwarentire ime ase enyomba y’ane enchenu abanto b’ebisaku ebigeni abatarogeti ase chinkoro chiabo, na ase emebere yabo, kobeera ime ase enyomba y’ane na mwayekorire yabeire eyetachenegeti, ekero mokorua asende okoruegwa kw’endagera, na ebitinya, na amanyinga. Inwe mwasaririe okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania, boigo mwakorire ogokora konde gwonsi gw’okogechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanyene timobeti mogokorera ebinto biane ebichenu, korende mwabekire abanto abaao bakaba bakobikorera ase enyomba y’ane enchenu ribaga riaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, aya naro inche Omonene ngoteeba: Omonto onde bwensi bw’egesaku ekegeni otarogeti ase enkoro, na ase omobere, ore ase egati y’Abaisraeli, tabaisa gosoa ase enyomba y’ane enchenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abalawi bakorusigwa ase obokuani bwabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abalawi abwo baruete asende bagantiga, bakagenda gosasiima emegwekano yabo, ekero Abaisraeli bande basaretie; egesusuro ki’ogosaria kwabo nkebairanere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo baranyare gokora emeremo ase enyomba y’ane enchenu, naende bagenderere korenda ebiita bi’enyomba y’ane na gokora emeremo ende ase enyomba eyio; mbabe bakonyenya ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na ebing’wanso binde ase engencho y’ abanto, mbabe bagotenena ase amasio abo kobakorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera abakuani abwo batenenete ase amasio y’ abanto gokorera emegwekano yabo bagosasiima, na igo bakaba ekegocha ase Abaisraeli, bakagera barabwo bagakora ebibe, ase ayio inche Omonene natianire ng’a egesusuro ki’ogosaria kwabo goika kebairanere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibagonkore buna Abakuani gose gocha ang’e ase ebinto biane ebichenu, gose ase ebio bire ebichenu mono. Goika berorere obosooku bw’ogokora kwabo gw’okogechia okwo babeire bagokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nimbabeeke babe abarendi be Hekalu, babe bagokora emeremo ende yonsi eganeirie aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abakuani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende abakuani Abalawi, abwo b’ororeria rwa Zadoki, abwo bagendererete gonkorera ase enyomba y’ane enchenu, ekero Abaisraeli bande basaretie bagantiga, barabwo mbache ang’e nainche bankorere, mbabe bagotenena ase obosio bwane banduere ebitinya na amanyinga. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo mbasoe ase enyomba y’ane enchenu, bache ang’e nemesa y’ane bankorere, naende bagenderere korenda amang’ana ane nachiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero barabe bagosoa ase ebiita bigosoerwa ase eraaro ya ime, babeeke chianga chiroisirie korwa ase egatani. Tibaabaisa kobeeka chianga chiroisirie korwa ase amarionya, ekero bagendererete gokora emeremo agwo ase amaagacho are egeita kegosoerwa ase eraaro ya ime, na ime ase enyomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo mbabeeke ase emetwe yabo ebitambaa biroisirie korwa ase egatani, naende babeeke chisirwari chi’egatani; tibakweboeria kende gionsi keragere bagiramore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero batarasoka gochia ase abanto bare ase eraaro ya isiko goika barusie chianga echio chi’obokoreri, bachitige agwo ase ebinyomba biria ebichenu, na babeeke chianga ching’ao. Batakoreti bo, nigo barabaise gochena abanto ne chianga echio chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abakuani abwo tibagokigita chitukia chi’emetwe yabo, gose tibagochitiga chitambee, korende nigo barachinache chieng’ee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani onde bwensi takonywa edivai ekero agochia gosoa ase eraaro ya ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere takonyuoma omokungu omotakaanwa, gose oyotiganire nomosacha oye, korende nanyare konyuoma omoiseke omwekungi bw’ororeria rw’Abaisraeli, gose nabo aranyare konyuoma omokungu omoborakabw’Omokuani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Barabwo mborokererie abanto bane bamanye gwatanana ebinto bire ebichenu na ebitatananiri koba ebichenu, naende baborokererie bamanye gwatanana ebinto bichenegete na ebitachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero amariomana are ase abanto, abakuani mbabe abagaambi b’ebiina, mbabe bakogamba ebiina ase okobwatia oboronge bwane. Mbarende emeroberio y’ane echiikire, na amachiiko ane y’Amatuko Amanene. Boigo mbarende Chisabato chiane chibe chinchenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omokuani tabaisa gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase ogokuna egetondo ki’omonto okuure. Nare ne ribaga gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase abanto aba: ise, na ng’ina, na omwana oye, omomura gose omoiseke, na momura omwabo, na moiseke omwabo oyotaraba nomosaacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Omokuani oyio achenirwe nabarerwe amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria arasoe ase eraaro ya ime ase obokoreri bwaye agwo Aase Aachenu, goika arue ekeng’wanso kiaye ki’ebibe. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
